#6200
The Cinder Road~
   A road paved with cinders and slag runs south from Midgaard's east gate.
The ground is black and the air tastes of iron. Ahead, chimneys belch smoke
into a sky that never clears, and the ringing of a hundred hammers never
stops, day or night.
