#6201
The Ironworks Gate~
   A gate of riveted iron plates stands in a wall of blackened brick.
Soldiers check everyone who enters, and everyone who leaves is searched,
because every nail and buckle belongs to the war. A board lists the quota:
FIVE HUNDRED BLADES BY THE NEW MOON.
