#6207
The Master Weaponsmith's Workshop~
   A quieter room with a single forge, where the finest blades are made for
officers and champions. Tools hang in perfect order. The master weaponsmith
works slowly, folding steel, and every blade she makes has a name engraved
on it before it leaves.
