#6210
On the Slag Heap~
   You climb the slope of glassy black slag. It is warm underfoot and in
places glows dull red beneath the crust. Scavengers pick through it for
scraps of iron. Near the top something has burrowed into the slag, leaving a
hole that breathes heat.
~
