#6211
The Conscripts' Huts~
   Rows of low turf huts, each holding twenty conscripts in a space for
five. Refugees from the camps, taken for the work because they were strong
enough to stand. They sleep in their chains. Some of them never wake, and
the carts come for those each morning.
