Inside a Conscript Hut~
   Darkness, the smell of unwashed bodies, and quiet voices that stop when
you enter. Someone has scratched a map of the Ironworks on the turf wall,
with the guard posts marked and a route out drawn in charcoal. They are
planning to run, and they are watching to see what you will do.
