The Mine Head~
   A great wheel of timber turns above the shaft, winding the cage up and
down on a creaking rope. A ladder runs down beside it. The guards here stand
well back from the shaft, and a fresh notice is nailed to the headframe: NO
DESCENT BELOW THE THIRD LEVEL.
