#6216
An Abandoned Drift~
   A side tunnel where the work stopped suddenly: tools dropped, a lamp
still on its hook, a half-filled cart on the rails. Scorch marks streak the
walls as though something burning ran along them. There are no bodies, only
ash in the shape of men.
